[[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datagen24/victual/issues/comments/6142687879","html_url":"https://github.com/datagen24/victual/issues/905#issuecomment-6142687879","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datagen24/victual/issues/905","id":6142687879,"node_id":"IC_kwDOUEWha88AAAABbiH6hw","user":{"login":"datagen24","id":20876965,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwODc2OTY1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20876965?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/datagen24","html_url":"https://github.com/datagen24","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/datagen24/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/datagen24/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/datagen24/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/datagen24/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/datagen24/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/datagen24/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/datagen24/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/datagen24/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/datagen24/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-13T09:37:53Z","updated_at":"2026-10-13T09:37:53Z","body":"Correction (2026-10-13): this issue's statement that \"user-field VALUES are already gated per parent\" was false for custom entities. `EntityReadPolicy::Check` returned early for any `userentity-*` entity, so `GET /api/userfields/userentity-<name>/{id}` returned custom-entity values to any authenticated caller.\n\nPR #906 (for #869) now gates `userentity-*` values behind `MASTER_DATA_EDIT`. When #906 merges, the per-parent statement holds for every entity. The `userfiles` gap this issue describes remains.","author_association":"OWNER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datagen24/victual/issues/comments/6142687879/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datagen24/victual/issues/comments/6145979136","html_url":"https://github.com/datagen24/victual/issues/905#issuecomment-6145979136","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datagen24/victual/issues/905","id":6145979136,"node_id":"IC_kwDOUEWha88AAAABblQzAA","user":{"login":"datagen24","id":20876965,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwODc2OTY1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20876965?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/datagen24","html_url":"https://github.com/datagen24","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/datagen24/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/datagen24/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/datagen24/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/datagen24/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/datagen24/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/datagen24/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/datagen24/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/datagen24/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/datagen24/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-13T12:52:40Z","updated_at":"2026-10-13T12:52:40Z","body":"## Maintainer decision — 2026-10-13\n\nRecorded from the maintainer (datagen24) during the 2026-10-13 bug bash, verbatim:\n\n> F1: c — ADMIN only. Permission to delete orphaned files does not establish permission to read potentially sensitive contents. Treat an unresolved owner as an orphan only after checking all supported reference forms.\n>\n> F2: a — every referencing owner must permit access. Deduplicate references. An unresolved or denied owner prevents access. Authorize the original file before reading or creating a picture derivative.\n>\n> F3: deny unless an explicit policy permits access. Do not treat api_keys, userfields and userentities as equivalent merely because they lack a policy entry. Preserve intentional non-exposure, including for administrators. Use ADMIN only where the owning record is itself administrator-readable.\n>\n> F4: yes. Apply the existing self-read exception to the user's own files, subject to F2 for shared references.\n>\n> F5: a. Keep the read fix bounded and file owner-based write authorization separately. Check whether the existing write paths can bypass the new read rule by attaching a protected file to another record.\n>\n> F6: a. Fix the shopping-list page's disclosure in a separate PR this round. Gate both the values and their file names on the applicable stock-read permission.\n>\n\nOptions and evidence were verified against master `01c3fa1b`.\n","author_association":"OWNER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datagen24/victual/issues/comments/6145979136/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datagen24/victual/issues/comments/6146307371","html_url":"https://github.com/datagen24/victual/issues/905#issuecomment-6146307371","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datagen24/victual/issues/905","id":6146307371,"node_id":"IC_kwDOUEWha88AAAABblk1Kw","user":{"login":"datagen24","id":20876965,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwODc2OTY1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20876965?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/datagen24","html_url":"https://github.com/datagen24","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/datagen24/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/datagen24/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/datagen24/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/datagen24/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/datagen24/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/datagen24/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/datagen24/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/datagen24/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/datagen24/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-13T13:10:29Z","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:10:29Z","body":"## Maintainer decision — 2026-10-13 (follow-up F3′)\n\nThe decision batch described `api_keys`, `userfields` and `userentities` as entities with no read policy. That was wrong: in `EntityReadPolicy`, `null` means open to any authenticated caller. The maintainer answered the corrected question, verbatim:\n\n> F3': (b), ADMIN only. Make this an explicit exception for files attached to userfields and userentities definition rows. Preserve their existing authenticated-read policy for definition metadata. Do not reinterpret EntityReadPolicy::null globally. api_keys files remain deny-all.\n","author_association":"OWNER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datagen24/victual/issues/comments/6146307371/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datagen24/victual/issues/comments/6147740207","html_url":"https://github.com/datagen24/victual/issues/905#issuecomment-6147740207","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datagen24/victual/issues/905","id":6147740207,"node_id":"IC_kwDOUEWha88AAAABbm8SLw","user":{"login":"datagen24","id":20876965,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwODc2OTY1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20876965?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/datagen24","html_url":"https://github.com/datagen24","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/datagen24/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/datagen24/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/datagen24/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/datagen24/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/datagen24/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/datagen24/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/datagen24/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/datagen24/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/datagen24/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-13T14:22:29Z","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:22:29Z","body":"Unresolved security dependency: #920. A `MASTER_DATA_EDIT` holder can clear a protected owner's file value, or delete the owning record, and then read the file. PR #919 (read gating) proceeds as a **partial fix**; this disclosure is not closed until #920 is resolved. Per the maintainer (2026-10-13), the F5 deferral was not acceptance of this bypass.","author_association":"OWNER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datagen24/victual/issues/comments/6147740207/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datagen24/victual/issues/comments/6153663817","html_url":"https://github.com/datagen24/victual/issues/905#issuecomment-6153663817","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datagen24/victual/issues/905","id":6153663817,"node_id":"IC_kwDOUEWha88AAAABbsl1SQ","user":{"login":"datagen24","id":20876965,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwODc2OTY1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20876965?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/datagen24","html_url":"https://github.com/datagen24","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/datagen24/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/datagen24/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/datagen24/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/datagen24/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/datagen24/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/datagen24/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/datagen24/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/datagen24/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/datagen24/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-13T19:38:45Z","updated_at":"2026-10-13T19:38:45Z","body":"## Maintainer decision — 2026-10-13 (view-backed owners)\n\nAsked: a userfile referenced from a view row (any ExposedEntity view can carry userfields). Answer: **resolve via the view key** — look the owner up in the view by the same key GetObject uses (`id`; `stock_id` for `stock`) and apply the view's `EntityReadPolicy` permission. A view row that no longer exists makes the reference unresolved, so ADMIN only. To be implemented in PR #919.\n","author_association":"OWNER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datagen24/victual/issues/comments/6153663817/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]]
